DESCRIPTION:Stand-up comedy crosses swords with Dungeons & Dragons. Catacom
 bs & Comedians is a live actual-play D&D show featuring four comedians as t
 hey venture in a realm of drollery and tomfoolery. Join Tyson Cox\, Cavin E
 ggleston\, Eric Sablan\, and Elliott White as they roleplay as an amusing a
 dventuring party of intrepid heroes as they venture in a realm of drollery 
 and tomfoolery.\nThe Catacombs & Comedians live actual-play Dungeons & Drag
 ons comedy show has performed in comedy clubs and theaters\, as well as wit
 h online streaming programs with dozens of stand-up comedians. The comedic 
 players never know what Dungeon Master Dan Taylor will throw at their party
 . From the monstrous Fowlboar (a cross between a giant turkey and a boar) t
 o Clownbolds (Juggalo Kobolds) to Spellbilly Warlocks. Nothing is too outra
 geous.\nWhat better way to celebrate the eve of the largest and longest-run
 ning gaming convention in North America than by rolling for hilarity and ma
 king a joke of the world’s greatest role playing game.\n\nPLEASE NOTE: ou
 r Upstairs showroom is 21+ and is NOT wheelchair accessible.\n\nManagement 
